WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.481 --> 00:00:19.565
An old sage was meditating alone.

2
00:00:22.006 --> 00:00:25.206
Suddenly lightning flashed brightly in his mind.

3
00:00:27.247 --> 00:00:30.888
He saw a blue dragon flying high above the land.

4
00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:35.721
"Ha-ha-ha!" A boy rode on its back, laughing.

5
00:00:38.302 --> 00:00:40.822
The dragon shot straight toward the palace.

6
00:00:44.824 --> 00:00:46.864
The sage stood up, shaking.

7
00:00:46.884 --> 00:00:52.266
"That was a troubling vision," he thought.

8
00:00:52.286 --> 00:00:56.427
"The boy on the dragon is a threat to the kingdom.

9
00:00:57.467 --> 00:00:59.868
I must speak to the king right away!"

10
00:01:05.272 --> 00:01:07.714
Police Chief Heup bowed to the king.

11
00:01:07.734 --> 00:01:13.178
"Your Majesty, a temple in Hapcheon was robbed," he said.

12
00:01:14.779 --> 00:01:15.800
The king frowned.

13
00:01:15.820 --> 00:01:20.383
"Why are you bothering me with such small matters?"

14
00:01:24.706 --> 00:01:28.088
Just then an old sage appeared and bowed.

15
00:01:28.108 --> 00:01:32.872
"I had a terrible vision, Your Majesty."

16
00:01:34.708 --> 00:01:37.751
The sage told the king about the boy and the dragon.

17
00:01:37.771 --> 00:01:43.336
"The boy will cause trouble in the kingdom!

18
00:01:44.157 --> 00:01:45.558
You must do something."

19
00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:48.641
The king laughed.

20
00:01:50.603 --> 00:01:54.927
"You all worry too much over little things.

21
00:01:56.188 --> 00:01:57.109
I'm the king.

22
00:01:57.730 --> 00:01:59.831
No one would dare challenge me."

23
00:02:05.508 --> 00:02:08.490
After robbing the temple, the bandits lived well.

24
00:02:09.211 --> 00:02:11.652
They didn't need to go out every day to steal.

25
00:02:13.133 --> 00:02:15.895
Everyone was happy, except Gildong.

26
00:02:15.915 --> 00:02:20.498
"I left home to find my own destiny.

27
00:02:21.859 --> 00:02:24.681
But now I'm leading a group of thieves," he thought.

28
00:02:25.842 --> 00:02:28.023
His father's words rang in his ears.

29
00:02:28.043 --> 00:02:31.526
"Always remember to do good in the world."

30
00:02:31.546 --> 00:02:37.726
"So, boss," Mok said, interrupting Gildong's thoughts.

31
00:02:37.746 --> 00:02:39.927
"What should we rob next?"

32
00:02:42.248 --> 00:02:45.210
"We shouldn't steal again anytime soon," Gildong said.

33
00:02:45.230 --> 00:02:48.151
"Soldiers are probably still searching for us.

34
00:02:48.972 --> 00:02:51.113
And the stuff we stole will last us a long time."

35
00:02:52.554 --> 00:02:53.514
Mok smiled.

36
00:02:53.534 --> 00:02:56.976
"I'm glad we have a smart leader like you."

37
00:02:59.958 --> 00:03:03.060
A thief named Chibong brought a small boy over.

38
00:03:04.516 --> 00:03:07.958
"I found him by our storehouse," Chibong said.

39
00:03:08.678 --> 00:03:10.199
Mok stomped his foot.

40
00:03:10.219 --> 00:03:12.520
"You little thief!"

41
00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:15.841
The boy burst into tears.

42
00:03:20.623 --> 00:03:22.064
didn't steal anything.

43
00:03:22.084 --> 00:03:25.565
I was looking for food for me and my sister.

44
00:03:26.526 --> 00:03:29.427
Our parents died, so we're all alone."

45
00:03:32.993 --> 00:03:34.373
Gildong looked at the boy.

46
00:03:35.194 --> 00:03:36.555
He was thin and dirty.

47
00:03:36.575 --> 00:03:38.916
"What's your name?"

48
00:03:39.256 --> 00:03:40.757
Gildong asked softly.

49
00:03:40.777 --> 00:03:43.758
"Boknam," the boy said.

50
00:03:43.778 --> 00:03:46.940
"What should we do with this thief?"

51
00:03:47.360 --> 00:03:48.361
Chibong asked.

52
00:03:50.582 --> 00:03:51.603
Nabi frowned.

53
00:03:51.623 --> 00:03:54.384
"He's just a hungry boy."

54
00:03:54.404 --> 00:03:58.967
"Besides, we stole our food too," Gildong said.

55
00:03:58.987 --> 00:04:04.161
At that, Mok and Chibong stopped scowling.

56
00:04:04.181 --> 00:04:07.222
"Give him a bowl of rice.

57
00:04:12.443 --> 00:04:14.664
He can stay here tonight," Gildong said.

58
00:04:14.684 --> 00:04:16.644
"We've got so much food.

59
00:04:18.645 --> 00:04:20.745
Let's take some down to the people in town tomorrow."

60
00:04:23.066 --> 00:04:24.726
Boknam wiped his tears.

61
00:04:24.746 --> 00:04:26.447
"Thank you!"

62
00:04:27.307 --> 00:04:29.027
Gildong smiled at the boy.

63
00:04:29.047 --> 00:04:30.648
"You're welcome."
